【解题思路】通过对比“解决问题”与“单纯记录”的区别，引导学生理解算法的本质是“解决问题的方法和步骤”，必须具有功能性和可操作性。
【易错点提醒】学生容易产生“只要写成第一步、第二步的格式就是算法”的误区，忽视了算法必须服务于“解决特定问题”这一核心目的。", "knowledge_points": ["KP1"], "cognitive_level": "理解", "difficulty": 0.6, "design_intent": "通过正反例对比，引导学生自主概括出算法的核心本质——它是“解决问题的方法”，且具有“步骤性”。", "design_rationale": "", "visual_aid_prompt": "画面左右并排展示两个文本框，左边是“番茄炒蛋步骤”（有1、2、3序号），右边是“小明日记”。中间有一个天平。默认状态下，天平处于倾斜状态。交互方式：学生可以点击两个文本框中的关键句子（如左侧“切番茄”、“下锅炒”；右侧“今天天气很好”、“我去吃了个苹果”）。反馈效果：点击后，被选中的句子会飞入天平两端的“解决问题”和“日常记录”托盘中。当左侧所有步骤正确归入“解决问题”托盘时，天平平衡，并高亮显示出课本中“算法是解决问题的方法和步骤”这一核心定义。", "visual_aid_type": "diagram", "visual_aid_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-src 'none'; media-src 'none'; object-src 'none'">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>算法与日记的对比</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; background: #f0f4f8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
        .container { width: 90%; max-width: 800px; background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        h2 { text-align: center; color: #333; margin-top: 0; }
        .main-view { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .box { width: 45%; border: 2px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; min-height: 200px; background: #fafafa; }
        .item { padding: 8px; margin: 5px 0; background: #eef; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px; transition: 0.3s; border: 1px solid #ccd; }
        .item:hover { background: #d1e7ff; }
        .item.selected { background: #ffeb3b; border-color: #fbc02d; }

        #scale-svg { width: 100%; height: 150px; }
        .balance-beam { stroke: #555; stroke-width: 4; }
        .tray { fill: #888; }

        #result-msg { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: #d32f2f; height: 30px; margin-top: 10px; }
        .definition { display: none; background: #c8e6c9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; border: 2px dashed #2e7d32; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h2>算法 vs 日记：你能分清吗？</h2>
    <div class="main-view">
        <div class="box" id="box-algo">
            <h4 style="text-align:center">番茄炒蛋步骤</h4>
            <div class="item" data-type="algo">1. 切番茄</div>
            <div class="item" data-type="algo">2. 打鸡蛋</div>
            <div class="item" data-type="algo">3. 下锅炒</div>
        </div>
        <div class="box" id="box-diary">
            <h4 style="text-align:center">小明的日记</h4>
            <div class="item" data-type="diary">今天天气很好</div>
            <div class="item" data-type="diary">我去吃了个苹果</div>
            <div class="item" data-type="diary">心情很愉快</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <svg id="scale-svg" viewBox="0 0 400 150">
        <line x1="200" y1="20" x2="200" y2="100" stroke="#333" stroke-width="6" />
        <line id="beam" x1="50" y1="20" x2="350" y2="20" class="balance-beam" transform="rotate(10 200 20)" />
        <circle cx="200" cy="20" r="8" fill="#333" />
        <rect id="tray-left" x="30" y="20" width="40" height="10" class="tray" />
        <rect id="tray-right" x="330" y="20" width="40" height="10" class="tray" />
    </svg>

    <div id="result-msg">点击句子，将其放入天平两端进行对比</div>
    <div id="definition" class="definition">
        结论：算法是解决问题的方法和步骤，具有明确的顺序和目标！
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    const items = document.querySelectorAll('.item');
    const beam = document.getElementById('beam');
    const resultMsg = document.getElementById('result-msg');
    const definition = document.getElementById('definition');

    let algoCount = 0;
    let diaryCount = 0;

    items.forEach(item => {
        item.addEventListener('click', function() {
            if (this.classList.contains('selected')) return;

            this.classList.add('selected');
            if (this.dataset.type === 'algo') {
                algoCount++;
            } else {
                diaryCount++;
            }

            updateScale();
        });
    });

    function updateScale() {
        // 简单的天平逻辑：左边多则左倾，右边多则右倾，相等则平衡
        let rotation = (diaryCount - algoCount) * 15;
        beam.setAttribute('transform', `rotate(${rotation} 200 20)`);

        if (algoCount === 3 && diaryCount === 0) {
            resultMsg.innerText = "太棒了！你找出了所有步骤，天平平衡了！";
            definition.style.display = 'block';
        } else if (algoCount > 0 || diaryCount > 0) {
            resultMsg.innerText = "观察天平的倾斜，思考哪一侧更符合“解决问题”的特征？";
        }
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>", "visual_aid_urls": [], "priority": 0.85}, {"id": "M3", "content": "如果我们在“穿鞋袜”的步骤里，把“第一步：穿鞋子”和“第二步：穿袜子”的顺序颠倒过来，会产生什么后果？这说明算法的步骤必须具备什么特点？", "question_type": "main", "lesson_presentation_script": "看来大家都同意，算法是解决问题的一步步方法。那是不是只要把步骤写出来，不管怎么排都可以呢？我们来看课本上这个有趣的例子：穿鞋和穿袜子。如果我们把顺序换一下，先穿鞋，再把袜子套在鞋子外面……哈哈，大家脑海里是不是已经有画面了？这显然是不对的。那么，从这个让人哭笑不得的例子中，大家能发现算法的步骤之间，有着怎样一种严格的关系呢？", "explanation": "【参考答案】如果顺序颠倒，袜子就会穿在鞋子外面，无法达到正常穿好鞋袜的目标。这说明算法的步骤必须是有先后顺序的，不能随意颠倒，顺序决定了结果的正确性。
【解题思路】用荒谬的实际后果引发认知冲突，引导学生将生活常识转化为对算法“顺序性”特征的理性认识。
【易错点提醒】学生在日常生活中对顺序习以为常，容易在设计算法时忽视步骤之间的逻辑先后顺序，认为“只要步骤都在就行”。", "knowledge_points": ["KP2"], "cognitive_level": "理解", "difficulty": 0.65, "design_intent": "利用荒谬的反例（先穿鞋后穿袜），让学生直观、深刻地理解算法“有顺序”这一特征的必要性。", "design_rationale": "", "visual_aid_prompt": "画面展示一个卡通角色的脚部，以及“穿袜子”和“穿鞋子”两个可拖拽的步骤卡片。默认状态下，两张卡片并排。交互方式：学生可以拖拽卡片到“步骤1”和“步骤2”的插槽中，然后点击“执行”按钮。反馈效果：如果学生将“穿鞋”放在“穿袜”前，画面中的卡通角色会把一只大袜子套在皮鞋外面，并露出尴尬的表情，同时弹出红色提示“顺序错啦！”；若顺序正确，则播放顺利穿好鞋袜的动画，并高亮显示词条“特征一：有顺序”。", "visual_aid_type": "illustration", "visual_aid_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-src 'none'; media-src 'none'; object-src 'none'">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>算法的顺序性</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; background: #f0f4f8; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
        #canvas-container { width: 600px; height: 450px; background: white; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .step-slot { width: 120px; height: 160px; border: 3px dashed #ccc; border-radius: 10px; position: absolute; top: 50px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; color: #999; }
        .card { width: 110px; height: 50px; background: #4a90e2; color: white; border-radius: 8px; cursor: grab; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: absolute; z-index: 10; user-select: none; }
        #btn-run { position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 250px; padding: 10px 30px; font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer; background: #2ecc71; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; }
        #feedback { position: absolute; top: 220px; width: 100%; text-align: center; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s; }
        .character { position: absolute; bottom: 50px; left: 200px; font-size: 80px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="canvas-container">
        <div style="text-align: center; padding: 10px; font-size: 20px;">请将步骤拖入槽位：</div>
        <div id="slot1" class="step-slot" style="left: 100px;">步骤 1</div>
        <div id="slot2" class="step-slot" style="left: 380px;">步骤 2</div>

        <div id="card-sock" class="card" style="top: 300px; left: 100px;">穿袜子</div>
        <div id="card-shoe" class="card" style="top: 300px; left: 380px;">穿鞋子</div>

        <div id="character" class="character">🦶</div>
        <div id="feedback"></div>
        <button id="btn-run">执行算法</button>
    </div>

    <script>
        const cards = [document.getElementById('card-sock'), document.getElementById('card-shoe')];
        const slots = [document.getElementById('slot1'), document.getElementById('slot2')];
        const btn = document.getElementById('btn-run');
        const feedback = document.getElementById('feedback');
        const char = document.getElementById('character');

        let pos = { sock: null, shoe: null };

        cards.forEach(card => {
            card.addEventListener('mousedown', startDrag);
        });

        function startDrag(e) {
            let shiftX = e.clientX - e.target.getBoundingClientRect().left;
            let shiftY = e.clientY - e.target.getBoundingClientRect().top;

            function move(e) {
                e.target.style.left = e.pageX - shiftX + 'px';
                e.target.style.top = e.pageY - shiftY + 'px';
            }

            function stop() {
                document.removeEventListener('mousemove', move);
                document.removeEventListener('mouseup', stop);
                checkDrop(e.target);
            }

            document.addEventListener('mousemove', move);
            document.addEventListener('mouseup', stop);
        }

        function checkDrop(card) {
            slots.forEach((slot, index) => {
                let rect = slot.getBoundingClientRect();
                if (card.getBoundingClientRect().left > rect.left - 50 && card.getBoundingClientRect().left < rect.left + 50) {
                    card.style.left = rect.left + 'px';
                    card.style.top = rect.top + 'px';
                    if (card.id === 'card-sock') pos.sock = index + 1;
                    if (card.id === 'card-shoe') pos.shoe = index + 1;
                }
            });
        }

        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!pos.sock || !pos.shoe) {
                alert("请先将两个步骤都放入槽位！");
                return;
            }

            if (pos.sock === 1 && pos.shoe === 2) {
                feedback.innerText = "成功！算法特征：有顺序";
                feedback.style.color = "#2ecc71";
                char.innerText = "😊";
            } else {
                feedback.innerText = "顺序错啦！袜子穿在鞋子外面了！";
                feedback.style.color = "#e74c3c";
                char.innerText = "🤡";
            }
            feedback.style.opacity = 1;
        });
    </script>
</body>
